# E-Commerce Data Warehouse & Revenue Optimization Dashboard

A portfolio-ready analytics project that builds a star-schema data warehouse for e-commerce sales, creates a SQL reporting layer, and outlines a Power BI executive dashboard for operational and revenue insight.

## Project summary

This project demonstrates end-to-end business intelligence work: data modeling, mock data generation, SQL warehousing, BI-ready reporting, and dashboard design. It is designed to showcase analytical thinking for portfolio presentations, case studies, and strategic data storytelling.

## Business value

The solution helps stakeholders answer questions such as:

- Which products and categories generate the most revenue and margin?
- Are sales growing year over year?
- Which customer segments are most valuable?
- Which regions are driving demand?
- How healthy is fulfillment performance?

