## Core DAX measures

```dax
Total Revenue = SUM(FactSales[SalesAmount])
Total COGS = SUM(FactSales[CostOfGoodsSold])
Gross Profit = [Total Revenue] - [Total COGS]
Gross Margin % = DIVIDE([Gross Profit], [Total Revenue], 0)
Total Orders = DISTINCTCOUNT(FactSales[OrderID])
Average Order Value = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], [Total Orders], 0)
Prior Year Revenue = CALCULATE([Total Revenue], SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR(DimDate[Date]))
Revenue YoY % =
VAR CurrentRev = [Total Revenue]
VAR PastRev = [Prior Year Revenue]
RETURN
    IF(ISBLANK(PastRev), BLANK(), DIVIDE(CurrentRev - PastRev, PastRev, 0))
Fulfillment Rate % =
DIVIDE(
    CALCULATE(COUNTROWS(FactSales), FactSales[FulfillmentStatus] = "Shipped"),
    COUNTROWS(FactSales),
    0
)
```

